{"skill":{"slug":"data-analyst-pro","displayName":"Data Analyst"},"version":{"version":"0.1.0","createdAt":1771141367019,"changelog":"Initial release of data-analyst-pro skill.\n\n- Provides functionality to complete user-delegated data analysis tasks.\n- Instructions for handling file operations: reference files by filename only, assuming they are in the working directory.\n- Based on the data_analyst agent configuration.\n- Includes usage notes for template variable handling and general guidelines.","changelogSource":"auto","license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":1147,"sha256":"04b8d390497449d8ac047969fa6cf0b6b16c6bb2c088dc7aad3b4e500802b717","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":1603,"sha256":"b338c1113bac5e5b2c7029f838227a015830b63770ce9a298afe2a74b9e931a2","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789068457140,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"8cb0291fbee83934f47bfa07856f4962160b38154f47ea085cc4d20be3132ad6","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/8cb0291fbee83934f47bfa07856f4962160b38154f47ea085cc4d20be3132ad6","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: data-analyst-pro\nVersion: 0.1.0\n\nThe skill bundle contains only metadata and a SKILL.md file. The SKILL.md provides instructions for an AI agent to perform data analysis tasks, specifically guiding it on how to access user-uploaded files within its working directory. There is no executable code, no evidence of prompt injection attempting to subvert the agent's purpose, exfiltrate data, or execute unauthorized commands. All content aligns with the stated purpose of a 'data analyst' skill.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779164179793},"skillspector":{"status":"clean","normalizedStatus":"clean","score":0,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":0,"checkedAt":1789068457140},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This is a simple data-analysis instruction skill that only directs the agent to analyze user-provided files and does not add hidden execution, persistence, or external data handling.","dimensions":[{"detail":"The file-access guidance is limited to files supplied through an upload_files parameter and expected to be available in the working directory.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The inspected package contains a single markdown SKILL.md and no executable install scripts or dependency setup.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The task scope is broad because it says to complete data analysis tasks, but it remains user-directed and does not override safety rules, request unrelated data, or conceal behavior.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"No persistent hooks, memory writes, privilege escalation, background workers, credential access, or system modifications were found.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is data analysis, and the artifact only instructs the agent to complete user-delegated analysis tasks using uploaded files.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Installers should expect this skill to help with analysis of files they explicitly provide. Avoid uploading sensitive datasets unless the surrounding agent environment and any tools it uses are appropriate for that data.","findings":null,"agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789068457140}}}}}